    "text": "Let $\\alpha \\beta \\neq 0$ and $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr}\\beta & \\alpha & 3 \\\\ \\alpha & \\alpha & \\beta \\\\ -\\beta & \\alpha & 2 \\alpha\\end{array}\\right]$. If $B=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr}3 \\alpha & -9 & 3 \\alpha \\\\ -\\alpha & 7 & -2 \\alpha \\\\ -2 \\alpha & 5 & -2 \\beta\\end{array}\\right]$ is the matrix of cofactors of the elements of $A$, then $\\operatorname{det}(A B)$ is equal to :"
  },
