  "solution": {
    "text": "Equating co-factor fo $\\mathrm{A}_{21}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left(2 \\alpha^2-3 \\alpha\\right)=\\alpha \\\\\n& \\alpha=0,2 \\text { (accept) }\n\\end{aligned}$<br />Now, $2 \\alpha^2-\\alpha \\beta=3 \\alpha$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\alpha=2 \\quad \\beta=1 \\\\\n& |\\mathrm{AB}|=|\\mathrm{A} \\operatorname{cof}(\\mathrm{A})|=|\\mathrm{A}|^3 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~A}=\\left|\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 2 & 3 \\\\\n2 & 2 & 1 \\\\\n-1 & 2 & 4\n\\end{array}\\right|=6-2(9)+3(6)=6\n\\end{aligned}$"
